           INITIALIZE UGTCT37
           MOVE '1254'       TO  T37-SECCION
           MOVE MAE-SUBPRO   TO  T37-ELEMENTO
           SET NO-REMODELACION                TO TRUE
           PERFORM 211CO-BUSCAR-UGDTT37
           IF T37-RESTO NOT EQUAL SPACES AND LOW-VALUES
            SET SI-REMODELACION             TO TRUE
           END-IF
