      ******************************************************************
       2801A2-BUSCA-GARANTIA.
           PERFORM 2801A21-OPEN-CUR-GARREM
           PERFORM 2801A22-FETCH-CUR-GARREM UNTIL SI-FIN-CURSOR
           PERFORM 2801A23-CLOSE-CUR-GARREM
           .
      ******************************************************************
