      *                 2801A21-OPEN-CUR-GARREM                        *
      * _____________________________________________________________  *
      *    ABRE EL CURSOR GARREM PARA BUSCAR GARANTIA REMODELACION     *
      ******************************************************************
       2801A21-OPEN-CUR-GARREM.
           INITIALIZE WV-VARS
           SET NO-FIN-CURSOR                 TO TRUE
           EXEC SQL
             OPEN GARREM
           END-EXEC
           EVALUATE SQLCODE
            WHEN ZEROS
             CONTINUE
            WHEN OTHER
             MOVE 'UGE0939'                  TO CAA-COD-ERROR
             MOVE 'ERR OPEN CURSOR     '     TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
             MOVE 'GARREM    '               TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(1:10)
             MOVE SQLCODE                    TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(11: )
             PERFORM 999999-ROLLBACK
             PERFORM 3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
           END-EVALUATE
           .
      ******************************************************************
      *                                                                *
      *                 2801A22-FETCH-CUR-GARREM                       *
      * _____________________________________________________________  *
      *    RECORRE REGISTROS CURSOR GARREM   GARANTIA REMODELACION     *
      ******************************************************************
       2801A22-FETCH-CUR-GARREM.
           EXEC SQL
             FETCH GARREM
              INTO :WV-ENTIDAD-GAR,
                   :WV-CENTRO-GAR,
                   :WV-CUENTA-GAR,
                   :WV-CODIGAR
           END-EXEC
           EVALUATE SQLCODE
            WHEN ZEROS
             PERFORM 2801A221-VALIDA-GAR-REM
             IF SI-GAR-REMODELACION
              SET SI-FIN-CURSOR              TO TRUE
             END-IF
            WHEN +100
              SET SI-FIN-CURSOR              TO TRUE
            WHEN OTHER
             MOVE 'UGE0939'                  TO CAA-COD-ERROR
             MOVE 'ERR CLOSE CURSOR    '     TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
             MOVE 'GARREM    '               TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(1:10)
             MOVE SQLCODE                    TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(11: )
             PERFORM 999999-ROLLBACK
             PERFORM 3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
           END-EVALUATE
           .
