      ******************************************************************
       2801A41-VALIDA-SI-LEASING.
           INITIALIZE UGTCT37
           MOVE '1250'       TO  T37-SECCION
           MOVE WV-SUBPRO    TO  T37-ELEMENTO
           SET NO-LEASING-HABIT               TO TRUE
           PERFORM 211CO-BUSCAR-UGDTT37
           IF T37-RESTO NOT EQUAL SPACES
              SET SI-LEASING-HABIT            TO TRUE
           END-IF
