      ******************************************************************
       2314-UPDATE-QUM.
      *
           MOVE CAA-NETNAME-CONT              TO QUM-NETNAME-UMO
           MOVE CAA-USERID                    TO QUM-USERID-UMO
           MOVE CAA-ENTIDAD                   TO QUM-ENTIDAD-UMO
