      *PASP0128062002
      *    COMPUTE WS-CAPITAL = MAE-CAPSOLI
      *    END-COMPUTE
      *
      *    IF MAE-IMPCONCE > MAE-CAPSOLI
      *       COMPUTE WS-CAPITAL = MAE-IMPCONCE
      *    ELSE
      *       COMPUTE WS-CAPITAL = MAE-CAPSOLI
      *    END-IF
      *
      *EFR01-I
           MOVE SPACES                        TO MOV-IND-MARCA3
           IF SW-SI-PUNICA
              IF SW-NO-MOV-PU
                 COMPUTE WS-CAPITAL = MAE-IMPCONCE - WS-CAP-PUNICA
              ELSE
                 MOVE 'U'                     TO MOV-IND-MARCA3
                 COMPUTE WS-CAPITAL = WS-CAP-PUNICA
              END-IF
           ELSE
      *EFR01-F
           COMPUTE WS-CAPITAL = MAE-IMPCONCE
      *EFR01-I
           END-IF
      *EFR01-F

      *PASP0228062002
      *@COL193-I
           IF WS-INTERES-CAPIT > ZEROS AND MAE-UGYEMCED EQUAL 'S'
              SET SI-MOV-INT-CAP            TO TRUE
              COMPUTE WS-CAPITAL = WS-CAPITAL -  WS-INTERES-CAPIT
           END-IF
      *@COL193-F
      *COL217-I
           IF WS-CAPIT-UNIFIC > ZEROS AND WS-SI-GDE
              COMPUTE WS-CAPITAL = WS-CAPITAL + WS-CAPIT-UNIFIC
