                      MOVE 'UGE0939'               TO CAA-COD-ERROR
                      MOVE 'VLR. SOLIC. ES MAYOR ' TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
                      MOVE 'AL LIM. PARA 60 MESES' TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR
                      PERFORM 999999-ROLLBACK
                      PERFORM 3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
                   END-IF
                END-IF
                IF WS-LINCRE = '05' OR WS-LINCRE = '15'
                   IF WS-PLAZO-MAE < CTE-72
