                      MOVE 'VLR. SOLIC. ES MAYOR ' TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
                      MOVE 'AL LIM. PARA 72 MESES' TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR
                      PERFORM 999999-ROLLBACK
                      PERFORM 3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
