                   END-IF
               WHEN DB2-NOTFND
                   MOVE 'UGE0939'             TO CAA-COD-ERROR
                   MOVE 'PROY. CONSTRUCTOR  ' TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
                   MOVE 'NO EXISTE EN TABLAS' TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
                   PERFORM 999999-ROLLBACK
                   PERFORM 3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
               WHEN OTHER
                   MOVE 'UGE0939'             TO CAA-COD-ERROR
                   MOVE 'ERROR DB2 UGDTMPC  ' TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
                   STRING 'CODIGO: ' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                     DB2-TEXT DELIMITED BY SIZE
