       2060-VALIDA-RETANQUEO.
             INITIALIZE UGTCLOG
             MOVE MAE-ENTIOFI      TO LOG-ENTIOFI
             MOVE MAE-CUENTA       TO LOG-CUENTA
             MOVE 'RETA'           TO LOG-CODIGO

