      * BUSCAR EN T37 EN SECCION 1686 PARA VERIFICAR SI ES             *
      * CONSUMO PASARELA DE PAGOS CON TIPO DE GASTO                    *
      *================================================================*
        10320-VALIDAR-CREDITO-PYPG.
      *
           SET  SW-NO-PYPG           TO TRUE
           INITIALIZE                UGTCT37
           MOVE SPACES               TO WS-CD-GASTO-PYPG
           MOVE '1686'               TO T37-SECCION
           MOVE MAE-SUBPRO           TO T37-ELEMENTO(1:4)
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SELECT
                     RESTO
              INTO
                     :T37-RESTO
              FROM  UGDTT37
              WHERE SECCION    = :T37-SECCION
                AND ELEMENTO   = :T37-ELEMENTO
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE SQLCODE              TO DB2-RETURN-CDE, P1-SQLCODE
           IF DB2-OK
              MOVE T37-RESTO(1:3)    TO WS-CD-GASTO-PYPG
              SET  SW-SI-PYPG        TO TRUE
