           MOVE MAE-FECPRILIQ                  TO GAP-FEOPER-A
           MOVE MAE-FECPRILIQ                  TO GAP-FEOPER-C
           MOVE WS-VR-GMFPYU                   TO GAP-IMPGASMA
           MOVE ZEROES                         TO GAP-IMPGASRE
           MOVE '4'                            TO GAP-INDRECU
