      *COL160-MALD4-F
      *@COL161-I
      ******************************************************************
      *                    2065-ADICIONA-DIFERIDOS                     *
      ******************************************************************
      *SE EXTRAE VALORES DE INTERES Y SEGUROS DIFERIDOS Y SE ADICIONAN *
      *LOS CAMPOS RESPECTIVOS PARA SER VISUALIZADOS EN EL DESGLOSE     *
	     ******************************************************************
       2065-ADICIONA-DIFERIDOS.

           PERFORM 2065A-OPEN-MOVDIF
           PERFORM 2065B-FETCH-MOVDIF  UNTIL SI-FIN-MOVDIF
           PERFORM 2065C-CLOSE-MOVDIF.
      *
	     ******************************************************************
      *                      2065A-OPEN-MOVDIF                         *
      ******************************************************************
	     *
       2065A-OPEN-MOVDIF.

           INITIALIZE  UGTCMOV
           INITIALIZE  WS-SEGUROS-DIF
           MOVE REL-ENTIOFI      TO  MOV-ENTIOFI
           MOVE REL-CUENTA       TO  MOV-CUENTA
           MOVE CAA-FECHA-OPER2  TO  MOV-FEOPER

            EXEC SQL
                 OPEN MOVDIF
            END-EXEC

            MOVE SQLCODE    TO DB2-RETURN-CDE
            IF DB2-OK
                SET NO-FIN-MOVDIF    TO TRUE
            ELSE
               MOVE 'UGE0939'        TO CAA-COD-ERROR
               MOVE 'ERROR UGDTMOV'  TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
               MOVE 'SQLCODE'        TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(1:8)
               MOVE DB2-RETURN-CDE   TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(9: )
               PERFORM 999999-ROLLBACK
               PERFORM 3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
            END-IF.
      ******************************************************************
      *                        2065B-FETCH-MOVDIF                      *
      ******************************************************************
       2065B-FETCH-MOVDIF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
                FETCH MOVDIF
                INTO
                   :MOV-CLACON,
                   :MOV-IMPMOVI
           END-EXEC
      *
           MOVE SQLCODE    TO DB2-RETURN-CDE
