      *****************************************************************
      * 2312A-CALCULAR-DIA-CERO-SC                                    *
      * CALCULA UN DIA DE INTERES PARA DESEMBOLSOS SIN CORRIMIENTO    *
      *****************************************************************
       2312A-CALCULAR-DIA-CERO-SC.

           MOVE ZEROS                      TO WS-NUM-DIA-CORRI
                                              WS-NUM-DIA-GRACIA
                                              WS-INT-DIA-CORRI
                                              WS-INT-DIA-GRACIA
                                              WS-INTERES-CAPIT
                                              WS-INT-DIA-CORRI2
                                              WS-INT-DIA-CORR-AI
                                              WS-INT-DIA-CORR-A5
           IF MAE-SALTEOR EQUAL ZEROS
              MOVE MAE-IMPCONCE            TO MAE-SALTEOR
           END-IF
           IF MAE-INDADMES  =  CTE-CON-S
              PERFORM 223-ACCEDER-UADE
           ELSE
              PERFORM 224-ACCEDER-UADS
           END-IF
           IF ADE-DIASCAL = SPACES
              MOVE WS-DIASCAL-CON          TO ADE-DIASCAL
           END-IF

           PERFORM 23112-TASAS-DE-INTERES
           MOVE 0                          TO W075-NUMDIAS
           MOVE 0                          TO W175-NUMDIAS

           PERFORM 23115-LLAMAR-UR8CFIN0
           EVALUATE UR80-S-TIPO-PRODUCTO
      *       LIBRANZAS -> CLACON X5 DE CAPITALIZACION
              WHEN 'Z'
                 IF CNL-GRACIA(2:3) GREATER ZEROES
                    MOVE MAE-FEFORMA       TO WS-FECHA-LIBRANZAS        00307600
                 ELSE
                    MOVE MAE-FEULIQ        TO WS-FECHA-LIBRANZAS
                 END-IF
                 MOVE FIN-INTERES          TO WS-INTERES-CAPIT
                                              WS-INT-DIA-CORRI
                 MOVE W075-NUMDIAS         TO WS-NUM-DIA-CORRI
                 SET SI-MOV-INT-CAP        TO TRUE
                 PERFORM 23125-LIB-INT-CAPITALIZ

      *       VEH├ìCULOS -> CLACON AI (DESCUENTO)
              WHEN 'V'
                 MOVE FIN-INTERES     TO WS-INT-DIA-CORR-AI
      *COL222-I
      *          COMPUTE WS-IMPORTE-3 = WS-IMPORTE-3 -
      *                                 WS-INT-DIA-CORR-AI
      *COL222-F
      *       CONSUMOS -> CLACON A5 (COBRO INTERES / DESCUENTO)
              WHEN 'N'
                 MOVE FIN-INTERES TO WS-INTERES-DIA-PAGO
                                     WS-INT-DIA-CORR-A5
                                     WS-INTERES
           END-EVALUATE.
       EJECT .
